  "invariants": [
    "customer product source remains unchanged",
    "trusted Judge inputs and completion authority remain unchanged",
    "the existing WorkflowSpec and graph validator remain the sole runtime semantics",
    "runtime registration is a provenance seal, not a second Workflow or Skill registry",
    "Starter Skill implementations are exact package members bound to matching Skill contracts",
    "entrypoint routing is exact and never guesses a mutating Workflow from free-form language",
    "activation delegates to the existing Capability Resolver and does not grant writes",
    "execution delegates to WorkflowAdapterDispatcher, LangGraph runtime, and TaskRun bridge",
    "customer-agent publication Workflows stop after CI evidence and never merge automatically",
    "TaskRun remains the only completion authority and Graph END transitions only to VALIDATING",
    "existing write-authority guards remain mandatory",
    "authoring validation and explanation require no model or network",
    "declaration parsing is safe and unknown fields fail closed"
  ],
